WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.300
<i>A kingdom concealed in darkness, Deltora.</i>

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.650
<i>A royal heirloom, the Belt of Deltora.</i>

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:16.000
<i>Long ago, in this belt fashioned by the first king,</i>

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.750
<i>Seven gems were placed.</i>

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:21.600
<i>The gems possessed magical powers,</i>

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:26.350
<i>And were protected while the king's direct descendants wore the belt.</i>

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:33.150
<i>But, those gems were hidden in seven mystical lands.</i>

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>Since then, the kingdom of Deltora has been shrouded in darkness.</i>

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:42.700
<i>However,</i>

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:45.200
<i>The light of hope can be seen on the horizon.</i>

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:51.000
<i>Standing against the Shadow Lord, there is a boy who is on a quest to search for the seven gems.</i>

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:55.000
<i>With light and hope at their side,</i>

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.400
<i>They are off on their adventure.</i>

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:14.170
When I open this door
Kono doa akereba atarashii sekai ga

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:18.060
A brand new world is beginning
Ima hajimarunda

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:24.640
Even if there are painful things ahead
Tsurai koto ga aru toshitemo

00:01:26.330 --> 00:01:31.040
I will show you that I can overcome them all
Kitto norikoetemiseru

00:01:32.390 --> 00:01:38.800
I'm starting to walk in a brand new world now
Atarashii sekai ni ima arukidashita soko ha

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:45.030
And I'm sure there are [Dreams] and [Hope] there
[Yume] ya [Kibou] ga aru kara

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:48.250
This feeling is making my heart beat so fast
Dokidoki suru kono kimochi

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:51.380
And there's no one who can stop it
Darenimo tomerarenai

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:56.400
My heart is tightening and out of control
Kyun to hazumu kokoro

00:01:57.570 --> 00:02:00.760
So start flapping your wings from here
Koko kara habataiteiku

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:03.810
And soar high up into the sky
Ano sora he to takaku

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:09.780
Aiming for [Tomorrow] and [The Future] beyond
[Ashita] [Mirai] mezashite

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:13.110
We will definitely grow bigger someday
Itsuka ookiku nareru to

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:16.380
That's what I believed
Sou shinjiteiru no

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:21.540
That's why, just spread your wings
Dakara tsubasa wo hiroge

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:44.800
The Japanese Deltora Quest is brought to you in English by ToranSubs

00:02:57.250 --> 00:02:58.120
Jasmine!

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:03.890
Too tired to move?

00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:07.700
My legs have given in and I'm really starving here...

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:10.090
I doubt I even have energy to cry right now...

00:03:10.570 --> 00:03:12.640
That goes for everyone here.

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:14.600
Crying won't change anything.

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:16.200
I know that.

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:19.780
But no matter how far we walk, everything is just barren.

00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:23.500
That's exactly why the Shadow Lord's servants will find us more easily here, right?

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:27.510
They should have discovered what
happened in the City of the Rats by now.

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:29.240
They'll be after us in no time.

00:03:29.240 --> 00:03:32.700
I know that, but there's no point in walking aimlessly like this!

00:03:33.490 --> 00:03:37.210
Kree! Can you see if you can find safe place nearby?

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:42.350
Let's rest a little here, okay?

00:03:42.350 --> 00:03:43.840
At least until Kree returns.

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:54.610
That's...!

00:03:54.990 --> 00:03:57.000
Barda, Jasmine!

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:57.900
It's an Ak-Baba!

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:03.410
Both of you, this way, hurry!

00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:07.600
Faster!

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:09.060
Get in here!

00:04:23.710 --> 00:04:25.010
What about Kree?

00:04:25.010 --> 00:04:27.810
He's probably safe. The Ak-Baba doesn't seem to notice him.

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:32.210
Just how long are we going to hide?

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:34.600
Until it goes away, obviously.

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:36.330
How very patient of you...

00:04:37.190 --> 00:04:39.300
My father has endured far worse.

00:04:39.990 --> 00:04:41.780
Your father?

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:43.390
Jarred, huh...

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:46.690
Hey, tell us about it.

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:51.160
We can't move until the Ak-Baba leaves anyway, right?

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:52.810
Come on, tell me.

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:56.490
Even if you say that, I'm not sure where to start...

00:04:56.490 --> 00:04:58.310
Then just start from the beginning!

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:00.870
The beginning, huh...

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:15.150
My father, Jarred, spent his life inside the palace during his childhood.

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:21.100
He was raised together with Endon by the same
nursing mother despite their difference in status.

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:29.800
You've done it now...!

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:34.000
Jarred! Endon! I've told you countless times not to play in the flower bed, have I not?

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:35.450
Oh no, it's Min!

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:36.650
Let's run, Jarred!

00:05:36.950 --> 00:05:38.940
Stop right there, Jarred, Endon!

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:39.920
- We're sorry!
Stop right there, Jarred, Endon!

00:05:39.920 --> 00:05:40.420
- We're sorry!

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:42.510
Honestly...

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:48.610
<i>The two of them were raised together inside the palace,</i>

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:52.100
<i>Playing and studying together, just like brothers.</i>

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:58.660
<i>For Endon, who was born as a prince,</i>

00:05:58.660 --> 00:06:04.100
<i>Jarred was the only one he could call a true friend; someone he could trust when it came to anything.</i>

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:17.680
7 Years Later

00:06:17.680 --> 00:06:20.460
But one day, on a stormy night...
7 Years Later

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:29.670
Are you awake, Jarred?

00:06:29.670 --> 00:06:30.700
Y-Yes!

00:06:31.170 --> 00:06:34.100
Come quickly, His Majesty has passed away.

00:06:34.600 --> 00:06:35.780
Alton has...?!

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:39.520
<i>Does this mean that Prince Endon will success the throne?</i>

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:40.820
<i>At such an age?!</i>

00:06:47.290 --> 00:06:49.100
He hardly seems reliable...

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:51.530
Can he truly become the king?

00:06:51.530 --> 00:06:54.250
Enthroned right after the late king passed away...

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:55.700
Anyone would be perplexed.

00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:04.000
<i>Because of Endon's placid personality, not one of them believed him to be a reliable ruler.</i>

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:09.490
<i>However, after Endon adorned that article upon his waist, the symbol of royalty,</i>

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:11.590
<i>They all suddenly believed otherwise.</i>

00:07:11.590 --> 00:07:14.210
<i>Yes, it was the Belt of Deltora.</i>

00:07:34.570 --> 00:07:37.100
So this is... the Belt of Deltora...

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:38.960
Amazing...

00:07:38.960 --> 00:07:42.200
The Belt of Deltora is acknowledging Endon as the king!

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:57.420
Good work.

00:07:57.420 --> 00:07:59.800
You are dismissed, Prandine.

00:08:00.470 --> 00:08:01.340
Yes sir.

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:10.610
<i>The act of wearing the belt had become nothing more than a tradition.</i>

00:08:10.610 --> 00:08:13.590
<i>After the king wore it during his enthronement,</i>

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:17.400
<i>The belt was taken off, and immediately stored at the top floor of the highest tower.</i>

00:08:20.010 --> 00:08:21.260
Are they stupid or what?

00:08:21.260 --> 00:08:22.320
Lower your voice.

00:08:38.340 --> 00:08:42.480
If he had always kept it on, the gems
wouldn't have been stolen in the first place!

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:43.400
That's right.

00:08:43.400 --> 00:08:45.410
But that's what had been decided for him.

00:08:45.700 --> 00:08:48.740
<i>Jarred had started to doubt the belt's traditions,</i>

00:08:48.740 --> 00:08:53.400
<i>So he snuck into the library and read the Book of Deltora from the beginning.</i>

00:08:57.510 --> 00:08:59.200
This is bad, Endon...!

00:09:00.190 --> 00:09:02.990
As I thought, the belt must be worn at all times!

00:09:03.880 --> 00:09:07.880
<i>"He who becomes the King of Deltora should wear the belt always."</i>

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:12.470
<i>"Otherwise, the Lord of the Shadowlands will strike again."</i>

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:16.390
Father...

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:18.800
It's just too soon...

00:09:19.550 --> 00:09:22.100
Why did you have to leave so soon...?

00:09:25.610 --> 00:09:30.300
Do I really have the power to rule this country alone as you did?

00:09:33.480 --> 00:09:34.400
Jarred!

00:09:35.230 --> 00:09:37.420
I have something to tell you, Endon.

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:42.270
You can't! Even if you're my best friend, you're not supposed to be here!

00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:43.560
You're breaking the Rule!

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:44.600
Endon!

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:45.880
Just listen to me.

00:09:46.300 --> 00:09:50.220
You must wear the Belt of Deltora, at all times!

00:09:50.220 --> 00:09:53.100
Just like the previous kings and queens before you!

00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:55.350
What are you talking about?

00:09:55.890 --> 00:09:59.500
Anyway, we have to go to where the belt is right away!

00:09:59.730 --> 00:10:00.690
Come on!

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:04.630
We can't, Jarred! The Rule...!

00:10:04.630 --> 00:10:06.150
Who cares about the Rule!

00:10:06.150 --> 00:10:10.800
That's just something the chief
advisors went and made on their own!

00:10:11.700 --> 00:10:13.130
How could you say that...

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:17.100
As well as that, there's one other thing that's been bugging me.

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:19.490
Endon...

00:10:19.490 --> 00:10:23.590
Have you ever seen what goes on beyond the palace walls?

00:10:23.590 --> 00:10:24.760
No, I haven't...

00:10:24.760 --> 00:10:29.850
Have you ever walked outside with your own two feet and talked with the citizens?

00:10:30.700 --> 00:10:32.530
Have you ever walked with them?

00:10:33.420 --> 00:10:36.590
Of course I haven't! That's the Rule after all.

00:10:36.590 --> 00:10:38.690
But the same goes for you too, right?

00:10:38.690 --> 00:10:43.700
That's right. However, such rules are never once mentioned in the Book of Deltora!

00:10:44.900 --> 00:10:47.600
You don't wear the belt with you all the time,

00:10:48.200 --> 00:10:54.720
And you know nothing about the city of Del besides what the chief advisor, Prandine, has told you, right?

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:57.400
And is there a problem with that?

00:11:03.450 --> 00:11:04.480
Prandine...!

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:21.290
Prandine!

00:11:27.400 --> 00:11:28.900
How awful!

00:11:28.900 --> 00:11:31.720
What ominous things are you trying to put inside His Majesty's head!?

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:34.710
Just what are you scheming here, Jarred?!

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:36.280
Oh, I see...

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:38.780
You envy His Majesty, don't you?!

00:11:38.780 --> 00:11:42.230
And now you're trying to kill His Majesty, aren't you?!

00:11:42.230 --> 00:11:44.000
You dirty traitor!

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:46.970
That's not right! Trust me, Endon!

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:48.900
I did this all for you...!

00:11:49.690 --> 00:11:50.580
Look-

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:51.400
Watch out!

00:11:53.090 --> 00:11:56.210
Your Majesty, he has a knife with him!

00:11:56.470 --> 00:11:59.120
Guards! Guards, come quickly!

00:12:01.890 --> 00:12:03.700
Damn it, I fell into his trap...!

00:12:06.590 --> 00:12:07.410
Jarred?

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:08.900
What are you standing there for?!

00:12:09.400 --> 00:12:10.890
The culprit is Jarred!

00:12:10.890 --> 00:12:11.900
Jarred?

00:12:11.900 --> 00:12:13.150
He couldn't be...

00:12:13.150 --> 00:12:17.320
He was trying to attack His Majesty with a knife! After him!

00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:18.100
Yes sir!

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:20.100
Jarred...

00:12:20.610 --> 00:12:21.600
Why?

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:24.100
Prandine, you bastard!

00:12:24.860 --> 00:12:25.870
His Majesty was attacked!

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:26.210
-The culprit is Jarred!
His Majesty was attacked!

00:12:26.210 --> 00:12:27.440
-The culprit is Jarred!

00:12:27.440 --> 00:12:28.970
-Seize Jarred immediately!

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:34.600
It's the tree we used to climb!

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:35.800
Oh, right!

00:12:37.840 --> 00:12:40.000
I'm pretty sure it was... right here...

00:12:42.540 --> 00:12:45.040
It's the code we used when we were young.

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:45.800
Endon...!

00:12:47.100 --> 00:12:48.400
Please notice it!

00:12:49.780 --> 00:12:51.980
If you erase the words that appear repeatedly...

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:55.640
"If you need me, aim high and I'll come."

00:12:55.640 --> 00:12:57.200
You should understand that!

00:12:57.870 --> 00:12:58.620
Endon!

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:01.800
Take care, old man!

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:09.900
I should leave the palace for now.

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:13.400
And return to Endon when the time is right!

00:13:14.090 --> 00:13:15.390
Alright, stop there.

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:22.200
What a terrible smell!

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:37.600
We're definitely travelling downhill... Then we must be outside the palace now.

00:13:44.480 --> 00:13:46.800
What's that mist- looking stuff?

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:54.100
I...Impossible...

00:13:54.840 --> 00:13:56.700
This is the city of Del?!

00:13:59.040 --> 00:13:59.940
<i>It's here.</i>

00:13:59.940 --> 00:13:59.960
<i>It's finally here...
It's here.</i>

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:01.500
<i>It's finally here...</i>

00:14:03.460 --> 00:14:04.700
<i>We're saved...</i>

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:31.100
Excuse me...

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:48.740
The beautiful city of Del... The city that we always used to gaze at...

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:55.190
<i>The beautiful city of Del that Jarred and Endon had seen since their childhood...</i>

00:14:55.190 --> 00:14:59.850
<i>The city that they saw from that tree was actually an illusion.</i>

00:15:00.490 --> 00:15:02.110
So they were deceived, huh...

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:07.340
Many generations of the royal family of Deltora have been deceived by evil magic for decades.

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:13.530
In the Book of Deltora it's written: "The Shadow Lord is clever and sly, and will never give up."

00:15:14.920 --> 00:15:18.230
The city of Del was already within his grasp at that time.

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:21.800
But, thanks to the belt, he couldn't lay his hands on the palace.

00:15:38.970 --> 00:15:41.870
<i>Perhaps, this too was destiny.</i>

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:44.800
<i>After all, the first king, Adin, was also a blacksmith.</i>

00:16:56.390 --> 00:16:57.600
E-Excuse me.

00:16:58.140 --> 00:17:00.790
Thank you very much for saving me.

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:15.800
Where did you learn to do that?

00:17:17.850 --> 00:17:19.780
I learned it back at the palace.

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:42.390
I will leave this place soon, but...

00:17:42.390 --> 00:17:48.580
Please don't tell anyone that I've ever stayed here, even if the palace guards come.

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:52.660
They will definitely say that I tried to kill the king.

00:17:52.660 --> 00:17:54.300
But it's not true!

00:17:55.370 --> 00:17:57.340
That really is too bad.

00:17:57.340 --> 00:18:01.120
Had you really killed the new king, then...

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:03.800
If anything, everyone would be grateful to you.

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:07.870
<i>"Why must we suffer in hunger and poverty...</i>

00:18:07.870 --> 00:18:12.100
<i>...While the aristocrats and the royal family live a life of luxury within the palace?"</i>

00:18:14.100 --> 00:18:19.300
<i>It was already an open fact that the people of Deltora had lost their trust in the king.</i>

00:18:21.060 --> 00:18:23.340
The guards won't come.

00:18:23.340 --> 00:18:26.110
I threw your clothes away into the sea.

00:18:26.110 --> 00:18:29.200
And I made sure that some guards would find them.

00:18:29.810 --> 00:18:33.100
So by now, they must think that you've drowned and died.

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:37.300
Do you have anywhere to go?

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:42.500
Then how about helping me with my work here?

00:18:44.730 --> 00:18:47.660
Those clothes are actually my son's.

00:18:47.660 --> 00:18:48.790
Your son...?

00:18:49.950 --> 00:18:52.280
He was killed three years ago.

00:18:52.280 --> 00:18:55.260
And his wife passed away long ago after giving birth.

00:18:55.890 --> 00:18:59.520
Their daughter ended up being raised by me.

00:19:00.170 --> 00:19:02.190
Her name is Anna.

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:10.430
<i>From that point on, Jarred became 'Jarred the Blacksmith' under Crian's guidance.</i>

00:19:12.400 --> 00:19:18.600
<i>However, even after after marrying Crian's granddaughter, Jarred still waited patiently for a signal from Endon.</i>

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:23.600
<i>It was impossible for him to contact Endon on his own.</i>

00:19:24.450 --> 00:19:29.320
<i>All writings addressed to the king were burned by Prandine without exception.</i>

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:35.560
<i>Jarred believed that Endon would definitely find the letter he left.</i>

00:19:35.560 --> 00:19:40.330
<i>And that there would come a time when Endon would realise that his words were correct.</i>

00:19:40.720 --> 00:19:43.550
<i>"Endon will definitely send the sign."</i>

00:19:43.550 --> 00:19:47.820
<i>Jarred believed that their friendship would never fade, no matter how much time passed.</i>

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:54.700
<i>And thus, he waited and believed in his friend,
Endon, and that the day would eventually come.</i>

00:19:57.830 --> 00:19:59.680
Jarred... Jarred..?

00:20:02.920 --> 00:20:03.700
Anna...?

00:20:04.130 --> 00:20:04.990
What's wrong?

00:20:05.320 --> 00:20:08.200
Nothing. It was probably just a nightmare.

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:11.490
Don't worry, it's already morning.

00:20:18.910 --> 00:20:19.700
It can't be...!

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:28.860
Those are Ak-Baba... Frightening birds that are said to eat dead flesh and live for a thousand years...

00:20:29.600 --> 00:20:32.400
It's also said that there are seven of them in the Shadowlands.

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:34.900
But why are they here in Del...?

00:20:35.510 --> 00:20:37.200
I don't know, but...

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:39.900
That's...!

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:46.000
That's it. There's no doubt about it...!

00:21:05.370 --> 00:21:06.500
A golden arrow...

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:09.200
It's the signal from Endon!

00:21:10.390 --> 00:21:11.700
So the time has come...

00:21:12.730 --> 00:21:13.900
It's finally come...!

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:21.100
My father told me that the gleam he saw that day was like a light of hope for him.

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:24.710
Jarred...

00:21:25.560 --> 00:21:30.200
He long believed in his friend and waited with hope for years for that moment to come...

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:33.440
And now, Lief has inherited that very feeling of hope from him.

00:21:33.990 --> 00:21:34.950
I see...

00:21:39.620 --> 00:21:41.760
Alright, it should be fine now.

00:21:44.000 --> 00:21:46.090
Guess it was worth the wait.

00:21:46.090 --> 00:21:48.300
Let's leave before it returns.

00:21:49.360 --> 00:21:50.190
Wait!

00:21:50.880 --> 00:21:52.230
What happened next?

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:56.540
Just how did Jarred and Endon meet up?

00:21:56.540 --> 00:21:59.010
And what happened to the two of them after that?

00:22:01.190 --> 00:22:03.900
I'll tell you the rest after we've passed that hill.

00:22:09.660 --> 00:22:11.540
We have to hurry then, right?

00:22:14.040 --> 00:22:15.200
I'm going first!

00:22:16.080 --> 00:22:18.700
Alright, seems like she's regained her vigor.

00:22:20.760 --> 00:22:22.910
Weren't we supposed to hurry?

00:22:22.910 --> 00:22:23.990
Alright, let's go.

00:22:24.070 --> 00:22:24.700
Yeah.

00:22:35.750 --> 00:22:41.250
Cherry blossom flowers are fluttering down
Sakura maiochite yuku

00:22:41.520 --> 00:22:46.920
As if they were peeled from the sky
Sora kara hagareru you ni

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:52.880
I'm gripping and holding hard
Anata to ita omoide ha

00:22:53.180 --> 00:22:58.650
The memories I have with you
Zutto gyutto dakishimeteru kara

00:23:00.120 --> 00:23:05.950
All of a sudden, flower petals are in full bloom
Futto maue ni ukabu no ha

00:23:06.430 --> 00:23:09.550
They're floating right above me
Mankai no hanabira

00:23:12.040 --> 00:23:17.330
No matter how long I wait, no one is coming
Mattetatte mou daremo konai

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:24.300
Have I really left my wavering feelings behind?
Yureru omoi ha oitekitandeshou

00:23:26.570 --> 00:23:32.540
I'm all alone right here, singing a song about cherry blossoms
Sakura uta utai nagara

00:23:32.840 --> 00:23:38.480
Just waiting for no one else but you
Anata wo matsu watashi ha hitori

00:23:38.800 --> 00:23:44.490
This love has taught something to me:
Kono koi ga oshiete kureta

00:23:44.890 --> 00:23:50.800
That true love is hidden on ordinary days
Heibon na hibi koso ai to

00:23:50.800 --> 00:23:59.010
I present my last song to the spring breeze
Harukaze ni saigo no uta wo

00:24:06.740 --> 00:24:07.800
Ak-Baba.

00:24:09.050 --> 00:24:11.190
With its sharp claws and beak,

00:24:11.190 --> 00:24:15.040
This frightening bird feasts on dead flesh and is said to live for a thousand years.

00:24:15.460 --> 00:24:19.200
It seems that they are able to feel the will of the Shadow Lord directly.

00:24:20.710 --> 00:24:24.520
After finding the promised arrow, Jarred and Endon finally met again.

00:24:25.040 --> 00:24:28.300
However, the Shadow Lord scattered the gems from the belt!

00:24:28.800 --> 00:24:30.690
Just what should they do to save the kingdom...?!

00:24:30.690 --> 00:24:30.970
The Stolen Gems
Just what should they do to save the kingdom...?!

00:24:30.970 --> 00:24:31.800
The Stolen Gems

00:24:31.800 --> 00:24:34.100
Next time, 'The Stolen Gems'.
The Stolen Gems

00:24:34.100 --> 00:24:34.610
The Stolen Gems
